[
  {
    "sentence_id": "P01-01",
    "role": "opening",
    "config": {
      "text": "A heart is placed on a scale.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P01-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "On the other side sits a single feather, the sign of Maat, truth and right order.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P01-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "People often say that the heart had to be lighter than the feather, and that if it failed, a monster would devour it.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P01-04",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "This is the famous Weighing of the Heart, from the Egyptian Book of the Dead.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P01-05",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "It sounds like a terrifying final exam.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P01-06",
    "role": "question",
    "config": {
      "text": "But what does the book itself actually say?",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P02-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "In this episode, we open the Book of the Dead itself: its real name, a list of wrongs never done, forty-two gods, a spell spoken to the heart, and the question of whether anyone was expected to fail.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P03-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "First, there was no single Book of the Dead.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P03-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "These texts were known by phrases such as going forth by day.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P03-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "In the New Kingdom, selections of these spells came to be written on papyrus scrolls and buried with the dead.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P03-04",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "The choice and order of spells varied from scroll to scroll.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P03-05",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "On some, the owner's name was written in later, in spaces left blank.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P03-06",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Some scrolls held only a few spells.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P03-07",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Others held more than a hundred and fifty.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P04-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "The name Book of the Dead is modern.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P04-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "In 1842, the German scholar Karl Richard Lepsius published a long papyrus kept in Turin, under the title the Book of the Dead.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P04-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "His numbering of its spells became the basis of the numbers scholars still use today.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P04-04",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "The judgment we are looking for is mainly in Spell 125.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P05-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Spell 125 takes the dead person into a great hall, the Hall of the Two Truths.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P05-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "There, the dead person speaks for themselves.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P05-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "They greet the great god, the lord of truth, and say that they know him.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P05-04",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Then they list the wrongs they never did.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P06-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Scholars call this the Negative Confession.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P06-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Its lines are short and plain.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P06-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Here are a few, from different versions, in an old English translation.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P06-04",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "I have not stolen.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P06-05",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "I have done no murder.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P06-06",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "I have spoken no lies.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P06-07",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "I have made no man to weep.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P06-08",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "I have not turned back water at its springtide.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P07-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Then the dead person turns to forty-two gods, and greets each one by a name and a place.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P07-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "The first is greeted as the one whose strides are long, who comes forth from Annu, the city the Greeks called Heliopolis.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P07-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "To each god, the dead person names one more wrong they did not do.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P07-04",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Knowing the names mattered.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P07-05",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "One version ends, I know you, and I know your names.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P08-01",
    "role": "question",
    "config": {
      "text": "But what if the heart disagreed?",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P08-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "For the Egyptians, the heart was the center of thought and feeling.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P08-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "It was believed to remember what a person had done.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P08-04",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "So another spell, Spell 30B, speaks directly to the heart.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P08-05",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "In an old translation, it begins, My heart my mother.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P08-06",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "It asks that nothing oppose the dead person at the judgment, and that the heart not be parted from them before the keeper of the scales.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P08-07",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Modern translators read it as a plea that the heart not speak against its owner.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P09-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "This spell was often inscribed on a heart scarab, an amulet in the shape of a beetle, and such scarabs were often placed on the mummy's chest.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P09-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "On this one, with a human head, the museum identifies the ten lines on the base as Spell 30B.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P09-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "The dead person did not face the scale alone.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P09-04",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "They brought their own words for the heart.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P10-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Now look again at the scale.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P10-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Here, the heart is not shown lighter than the feather.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P10-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "The two sides hang in balance.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P10-04",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Museum descriptions speak of the heart balancing with Maat.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P10-05",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Thoth writes down the result.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P10-06",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "And nearby waits Ammit, the Devourer.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P10-07",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "One old description calls her part crocodile, part lion, and part hippopotamus.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P11-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "But papyri made to help the dead live on are unlikely to show their owner being devoured.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P11-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "In the text, the heart is found true, and the dead person is allowed to go before Osiris.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P11-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "The scroll was made to help secure a good outcome.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P11-04",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "After their names, the dead were often called true of voice.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P12-01",
    "role": "question",
    "config": {
      "text": "So, could you fail the Weighing of the Heart?",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P12-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "As a fear, yes.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P12-03",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "That is why Ammit is there.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P12-04",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "But the Book of the Dead was made to help you pass.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P12-05",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "And its denials also describe a good life: do not steal, do not lie, do not make others weep.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P13-01",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Every story has an origin.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P13-02",
    "role": "plain",
    "config": {
      "text": "Sometimes, it begins with a heart, a feather, and a few words prepared in advance.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P14-01",
    "role": "conclusion",
    "config": {
      "text": "This video is based on historical texts and public museum collections.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P14-02",
    "role": "conclusion",
    "config": {
      "text": "The narration uses synthetic speech.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P14-03",
    "role": "conclusion",
    "config": {
      "text": "Sources and terms of use are listed in the description.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P14-04",
    "role": "conclusion",
    "config": {
      "text": "If you enjoyed this story, please like the video and subscribe for more quiet origins.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
      "speed": 0.82,
      "sentence_pause": 0.3,
      "clause_pause": 0.12
    },
    "gap_after": 0.3
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": "P14-05",
    "role": "conclusion",
    "config": {
      "text": "Thank you for watching.",
      "voice": "af_heart",
